      "evidence": "openspec/specs/platform-lifecycle/spec.md:1347 says \"For a coordinator-managed candidate whose head is behind main under the behind-mergeable contract, status SHALL report that state as not requiring reconciliation\". Scenario at :1357 is also candidate-only. The delta's exception text says \"developer evidence-producing validation, handoff, re-admission and status SHALL accept\" for quick tasks. The proposal says task_reconciliation.observe_candidate reads the same predicate. Quick-task status behavior therefore has no matching scenario or requirement text.",
