      "severity": "advisory",
      "summary": "The delta widens the second exception to quick tasks, including status. The separate requirement \"Freshness drift is visible before another expensive validation run\" is not modified, so it still limits the not-requiring-reconciliation status report to coordinator-managed candidates."
